{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/8fddc02ca6a31a66db1ce3a8d5daacb6.poster.avif?t=1759498002\" width=1170 height=367 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/8fddc02ca6a31a66db1ce3a8d5daacb6.webm?t=1759498002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><i><strong>Blueman</strong> is an office-worker simulator with horror elements.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/f1dbfb71c839ae0f5fd40d3d728777b6.avif?t=1759498002\" data-has-big width=1560 height=98 /></span>Rumors say people vanish without a trace in this corporation\u2019s offices. Newspapers report hundreds of disappearances\u2014employees seem to dissolve after night shifts, and the last time they\u2019re seen alive, they\u2019re heading to the elevator after midnight. The police refuse to comment, saying \u201cthe investigation is ongoing.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And still, the company\u2019s vacancies never stay open for long. Bills must be paid, and office work always seems so simple\u2026 until you\u2019re inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start as an intern in a demonic corporation where each level is a unique floor, blending routine tasks with strange new instructions. Colleagues and management will keep you from doing your job properly, and any mistake may end in termination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/3cca50b4877909d12c2c6b85e24be974.avif?t=1759498002\" data-has-big width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare the office for the next workday.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go up to the next floor.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Probation\u20149 floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/9e840508055e38c5cfe08dfd284f6d0e.avif?t=1759498002\" data-has-big width=1560 height=98 /></span><br>To reach the next floor, you\u2019ll need to double-check every action and make sure you\u2019ve completed every assignment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust the instructions. Don\u2019t ask needless questions. And remember: a bad employee is a dead employee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/ee4e25d603210d521306005659eb4ba7.avif?t=1759498002\" data-has-big width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 core tasks to master the routine and the rules.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 unique levels, each with its own mood and style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No saves\u2014your choices have a price.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 30\u201340 minutes.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3135260?t=1759498002","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/7c1e0fa7c74ea2a5021c0dbd9fcf85fd34a88b45/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759498002","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/398ac4efa2d93a6ae75a4c7a5be3c408e4754658/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759498002","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/398ac4efa2d93a6ae75a4c7a5be3c408e4754658/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759498002","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3987210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/8fddc02ca6a31a66db1ce3a8d5daacb6.poster.avif?t=1759498002\" width=1170 height=367 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/8fddc02ca6a31a66db1ce3a8d5daacb6.webm?t=1759498002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><i><strong>Blueman</strong> is an office-worker simulator with horror elements.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/f1dbfb71c839ae0f5fd40d3d728777b6.avif?t=1759498002\" data-has-big width=1560 height=98 /></span>Rumors say people vanish without a trace in this corporation\u2019s offices. Newspapers report hundreds of disappearances\u2014employees seem to dissolve after night shifts, and the last time they\u2019re seen alive, they\u2019re heading to the elevator after midnight. The police refuse to comment, saying \u201cthe investigation is ongoing.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And still, the company\u2019s vacancies never stay open for long. Bills must be paid, and office work always seems so simple\u2026 until you\u2019re inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start as an intern in a demonic corporation where each level is a unique floor, blending routine tasks with strange new instructions. Colleagues and management will keep you from doing your job properly, and any mistake may end in termination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/3cca50b4877909d12c2c6b85e24be974.avif?t=1759498002\" data-has-big width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare the office for the next workday.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go up to the next floor.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Probation\u20149 floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/9e840508055e38c5cfe08dfd284f6d0e.avif?t=1759498002\" data-has-big width=1560 height=98 /></span><br>To reach the next floor, you\u2019ll need to double-check every action and make sure you\u2019ve completed every assignment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust the instructions. Don\u2019t ask needless questions. And remember: a bad employee is a dead employee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/ee4e25d603210d521306005659eb4ba7.avif?t=1759498002\" data-has-big width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 core tasks to master the routine and the rules.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 unique levels, each with its own mood and style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No saves\u2014your choices have a price.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 30\u201340 minutes.</p></l